{"about_the_game":"<strong>SOUL</strong><br>Step into the world of Arcane Fighters, where nostalgia meets fun and competitiveness. It's a blast from the past that captures the spirit of sharing a keyboard with friends, all while relishing the joy of local multiplayer gaming.<br><br><strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621460/extras/e275dcdba248ecc69e670cc7c152b6ff.poster.avif?t=1706715763\" width=506 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621460/extras/e275dcdba248ecc69e670cc7c152b6ff.webm?t=1706715763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621460/extras/e275dcdba248ecc69e670cc7c152b6ff.mp4?t=1706715763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Arcane Fighters is a thrilling 2D platform Player vs. Player (PvP) experience, where you can engage in magical battles against your friends, employing cunning strategies and MAGIC! Dive into the world of arcane warfare and choose from various unique spells, crafting your ultimate strategy to outwit and outmaneuver your opponents.<br><br><strong>SINGLEPLAYER</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621460/extras/63741fac2ac2a3823ebc4f0b5e56796c.poster.avif?t=1706715763\" width=506 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621460/extras/63741fac2ac2a3823ebc4f0b5e56796c.webm?t=1706715763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621460/extras/63741fac2ac2a3823ebc4f0b5e56796c.mp4?t=1706715763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Arcane fighters also have a single player. That is targeted at player scores against other players around the world. A player is going to fight against a few enemies with time getting harder to survive and get a better score.<br><br><strong>STORY</strong><br>It isn't just a game; it's a time machine to those memorable moments when laughter filled the room and the competition was fierce. In an era dominated by online play, Arcane Fighters harks back to when gathering around a single screen was the pinnacle of gaming excitement.<br><br>Rediscover the thrill of shared controllers, the camaraderie of local play, and the joy of friendly rivalry with up to three friends. It's your chance to create new memories while treasuring the old ones.<br><br>Arcane Fighters: More than a game, it's a celebration of the past and a doorway to the future.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2621460?t=1706715763","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2621460?t=1706715763","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621460/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1706715763","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621460/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1706715763","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<strong>SOUL</strong><br>Step into the world of Arcane Fighters, where nostalgia meets fun and competitiveness. It's a blast from the past that captures the spirit of sharing a keyboard with friends, all while relishing the joy of local multiplayer gaming.<br><br><strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster